OL,3,AOregon teacher fought school attacker
OL,4,Abefore armed dad shot suspect 'multiple
OL,5,Atimes'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Oregon teacher threw her mobile
OL,8,Fphone before she tackled and tried to
OL,9,Fwrestle away a shotgun from the arms of
OL,10,Fa teen suspect who opened fire on a
OL,11,Fspecial educational needs class.
OL,13,FAs she tussled with him on the floor of
OL,14,Fthe class - where three children and a
OL,15,Fteacher were killed - a bystander ran
OL,16,Finside. Armed with a.40-caliber pistol,
OL,17,Fhe opened fire and killed the teen.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
