OL,3,AOregon teacher fought school attacker
OL,4,Abefore armed dad shot suspect 'multiple
OL,5,Atimes'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe bystander, a dad of two girls at
OL,8,Fthe school, had been driving past
OL,9,FSilver Rail Elementary in Bend when he
OL,10,Fsaw the suspect firing in the car park
OL,11,Fthen shooting through a window to
OL,12,Fenter.
OL,14,FThe details of the Thursday attack were
OL,15,Fconfirmed by police, who said the
OL,16,F16-year-old suspect was a prior student
OL,17,Fat the school.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
